title: Authorizations › New case › Workflow › What the workflow adds to the history
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId, then /authorizations/case/ID (History) and Case Manager
intro: The workflow leaves a short trace in the case's history: which workflow was applied, how far it ran at each stage change (steps done, skipped and waiting), the rules it read with their verification state, any override, the sign-off, and what was prepared versus what was transmitted. Before the request exists the lines wait on the draft; they are written to the request's History when it is signed and sent. A draft that is already a request on the case page writes them straight away. Lines are short; the detail sits under them.
dir: TD
also: The engine's line for a stage names the agent that works it (Verify at Eligibility & Benefits, Reader at Clinical documentation, Scribe at Authorization preparation, Integrity at Review & submit); 'Workflow applied' is Psyflo's; a person's choice, review or override is the person's; the 'Prepared for' line is Packet's. Nothing here is a payer fact.
---
start s1 "The workflow is applied, a stage is opened, a choice is made or the case is signed"
decision d1 "What happened?"
store a1 "'Workflow applied: Initial Authorization, Residential SUD v3 (Summit)'\nor 'Default workflow applied: Default process for a concurrent review'\nDetail: why it matched"
store a2 "'Workflow ran to Eligibility & Benefits: 3 steps done, 1 skipped (Check provider network: not needed for this plan)'\nDetail: the steps done and 'Rules read: Submission window (Unverified), ...'"
store a3 "'Waiting: ...' with what the workflow waits for"
store a4 "'Override: continued without confirmed coverage, reason documented'\nDetail: where, and 'Your reason: ...'"
store a5 "'Workflow updated: ... v3 to v4, reviewed by Jordan Perez'\n'Workflow changed: ... to ...'\n'Workflow chosen: ...'"
store a6 "'Workflow approval recorded: Dr. Rivera (clinician)'\n'Workflow ran to Review & submit: ...'\n'Override: signed with 2 warnings acknowledged'\n'Prepared for Summit (demo simulation). Nothing was transmitted outside this app'"
decision d2 "Does the request exist yet?"
process p1 "The lines wait on the draft\nThe 'Trace' button in the Workflow line lists them"
process p2 "Sign and send writes them to the new request's History, before the signature line\nTimes are the demo clock"
process p3 "The lines go straight to the request's History"
screen sc1 "Authorizations › the case page › 'History'\nEach line says who: Psyflo, you or a named agent\nThe 'Authorization facts' row has 'Workflow' with the version"
screen sc2 "Case Manager › tracker row quick view\n'Workflow' row and the three newest history lines"
screen sc3 "Case Manager › a case with no request yet\n'Workflow' row in the case summary and the lines in 'History'"
decision d3 "Is the case a request?"
end e1 "The trace can be read where the case is read"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › History"
goto g2 "Continues in: Case Manager › Ledger case › Workflow line and history"

s1 --> d1
d1 -->|Applied| a1 --> d2
d1 -->|Stage opened| a2 --> a3 --> d2
d1 -->|Override| a4 --> d2
d1 -->|Review or choice| a5 --> d2
d1 -->|Sign and send| a6 --> p2
d2 -->|No| p1 --> d3
d2 -->|Yes| p3 --> d3
p2 --> d3
d3 -->|Yes| sc1 --> sc2 --> e1
d3 -->|No| sc3 --> e1
sc1 -.-> g1
sc3 -.-> g2
